      "writtenOn": "2025-12-09T13:20:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks - yeah for users on gLinux it will be available in binFS without any extra work. We\u0027re working on a solution for gMac, but for now I didn\u0027t want to add any disruption to the upload flow for those users.\n\nI\u0027m going to test this out in a small directory first, so if there are any issues (e.g. with gcert) we can spot them there before doing a chromium-wide rollout.",
      "parentUuid": "4e449d5e_e4c360e3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2923,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2925,
        "endChar": 17
